Dear member,

The annual enrollment period for Medicare plans runs from October 15 to December 7. This is your chance to review your coverage, compare costs, and decide whether to keep or change your plan for next year.

Things to check: your prescription list and whether each drug is covered, your doctors and whether they remain in network, and your expected out-of-pocket costs. Your Annual Notice of Change explains what is different for you.

Free help is available. Call our member line or schedule a plan review with a licensed agent. We do not offer every plan available in your area; contact Medicare for information on all of your options.

Thank you for choosing Greenway.

